producing content, and the
final thing I would say is

00:12:49.898 --> 00:12:53.210
make it consumable based
on them, not on you.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:57.786
Meaning video, audio,
written word, all if you can.

00:12:57.786 --> 00:12:59.660
Now, if you're shy in front of a video,

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:01.050
which I have empathy, some are.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:02.380
