00:13:15.966 --> 00:13:18.270
And then also, you know what?

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:21.702
I put out a deck, an
88 page deck recently.

00:13:21.702 --> 00:13:25.200
I think it's titled Gary V Content Model.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.800
I literally just gave
all my, everything I do,

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:30.010
my secrets for free, it's out there.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.130
You should look at that.

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:33.934
The thesis is make
content and then interpret

00:13:33.934 --> 00:13:36.230
it contextual to the channels.

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:41.028
So, maybe a quote from this
talk becomes an Instagram quote

00:13:41.028 --> 00:13:43.040
