00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:50.109
This question is predicated
on the lack of the thing

00:14:50.109 --> 00:14:53.233
that I think people need to
fill, which is more creative.

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:57.640
One could argue, and my team argues

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:58.860
