shit that they don't want.

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:21.380
So, that is for sure.

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:25.100
That being said, there's
also a conversation

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:27.560
that should be had in our
industry which is difficult

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:29.200
because the technology advancements

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:32.437
of potential reach and actual reach.

00:15:32.437 --> 00:15:35.750
Potential consumption
and actual consumption.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.780
Meaning, I would also argue you could run

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.688
