00:15:44.125 --> 00:15:47.350
But the fourth I may,
you see where I'm going?

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:50.446
So I think this is why we
desperately have to tie

00:15:50.446 --> 00:15:53.325
this whole world into
if Milky Way was testing

00:15:53.325 --> 00:15:58.325
how it was doing in Dublin at sea stores

00:15:58.700 --> 00:15:59.902
